start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc {2ch [3dc 2ch]x3 2dc}@ring ss@top # ch 5 = 1 dc + ch 2
R2: sl@sp 3ch=dc 4ch [2dc@same 3dc 2dc@sp 4ch]x3 2dc@same 3dc dc@sp ss@top # ch 7 = 1 dc + ch 4
R3: 3ch=dc 4ch [2dc@same 7dc 2dc@sp 4ch]x3 2dc@same 7dc dc@sp ss@top
R4: 3ch=dc 4ch [2dc@same 11dc 2dc@sp 4ch]x3 2dc@same 11dc dc@sp ss@top
R5: 3ch=dc 4ch [2dc@same 15dc 2dc@sp 4ch]x3 2dc@same 15dc dc@sp ss@top
